cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this replication package, please cite both the article and this deposit."
title: "Replication package: Science Culture and National Innovation — The ECAB Framework and a De-Circularized Measurement Audit of Cognitive Human Capital"
abstract: >-
  Replication code and frozen data for a de-circularized measurement audit of the association
  between PISA-based cognitive human capital and national innovation outputs across 44
  countries and economies, 2012-2023. Includes the analysis pipeline, the frozen
  pre-interpolation and analysis datasets, all robustness, placebo and sensitivity scripts,
  and the frozen result files that are the provenance of every number reported in the article.
